    "describe_ch": "在工業環境下為協助產品設計與開發的三大部門:行銷/設計/製造之間或對於供應商與客戶之間的有效溝通, 藉由快速手繪產品(內部結構或外部設計)或空間(廠房動線, 辦公部門, 銷售部門, 展場等...)的表現技法訓練。",
    "describe_eh": "In the industrial environment, to assist the effective communication between the three major departments of product design and development : marketing/design/manufacturing, or between suppliers and customers, techniques of expression training by quickly hand-drawing products : internal or external design or space : workshop skills, office departments, sales departments, exhibition venues, etc.",
